    "Validate the consensus points: base damage (150), Attack (49), additive Hatred (+0.50), and irrelevance of spells/skills.",
    "Pivot from raw stat recall to game design / puzzle author intent: Ask why the author specifically assigned Bron exactly +1 Defense. If base Defense were 21, Bron's +1 is completely superfluous to the stance calculation because both $\\lfloor 21 \\times 1.2 \\rfloor + 1 = 26$ and $\\lfloor (21 + 1) \\times 1.2 \\rfloor = 26$. But if Devil base Defense is 19, Bron's +1 is the crucial linchpin that brings pre-stance defense to exactly 20, making Defend (+20%) resolve cleanly to 24 without any engine truncation ambiguity.",
