      "Then pivot: 'Even accepting 21 Defense, why do so many competitive damage calculators and test suites output 412?' Reframe it around combat calculation order: does the defensive stance bonus operate on base defense *before* hero stats, and how does the game engine handle the internal rounding and hero primary skill application in this specific combat script?",
